---
// Renders the "Get Involved" card. Wrap in a <section> with the desired background in the calling page.
---

<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto rounded-[2.1rem] px-6 md:px-12 py-10 md:py-14 bg-surface-warm shadow-card">
  <h2
    class="text-center text-[3rem] md:text-[3.8rem] leading-none mb-8 text-text-strong font-body font-medium"
  >
    Get Involved
  </h2>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-8">
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-text-strong mb-2 font-body font-extrabold">
        Cooperative AI Research Fellowship
      </h3>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-[1.2rem] text-text-strong">
        We are hosting a 3-month research fellowship developing core topics in cooperative AI,
        with world-class mentorship. Applications close on the 28th of September 2025. Find out
        more and apply on the
        <a href="https://www.cai-research-fellowship.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-link">
          website
        </a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-text-strong mb-2 font-body font-extrabold">
        Learn More
      </h3>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-[1.2rem] text-text-strong">
        If you would like to learn more about AI Safety,
        <a
          href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ggO5P0Tlsf2FF1kODc6G6_DZWIsERtI2hyIn74XOwgk/edit?tab=t.0"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="text-link"
        >
          here are some resources that we recommend
        </a>
        and that we keep up-to-date.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-text-strong mb-2 font-body font-extrabold">
        Contribute to AI safety work in South Africa
      </h3>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-[1.2rem] text-text-strong">
        We're looking for volunteers to support research, organise events, and build our community.
        <a href="https://tally.so/r/w4gD7b" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-link">
          Apply now
        </a>
        —we'll match you with opportunities that fit your skills and schedule.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-text-strong mb-2 font-body font-extrabold">
        Events Calendar
      </h3>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-[1.2rem] text-text-strong">
        We regularly host in-person events in Cape Town, as well as occasionally host online talks.
        You can stay up to date with events via our
        <a href="https://lu.ma/calendar/cal-p3BboQFpGbi3ioe" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-link">
          Luma calendar
        </a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-text-strong mb-2 font-body font-extrabold">
        Substack Newsletter
      </h3>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-[1.2rem] text-text-strong">
        We post a ~monthly newsletter, please
        <a href="https://aisafetysouthafrica.substack.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-link">
          subscribe to our Substack
        </a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-text-strong mb-2 font-body font-extrabold">
        Co-Working Space
      </h3>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-[1.2rem] text-text-strong">
        Apply to work at our beautiful
        <a
          href="https://airtable.com/appR0NwXFE9nxfdKA/pagIQJbgF9MMX1SMu/form"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="text-link"
        >
          co-working space
        </a>!
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-text-strong mb-2 font-body font-extrabold">
        Social Media
      </h3>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-[1.2rem] text-text-strong">
        Follow us on
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/ai-safety-south-africa/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="text-link"
        >
          LinkedIn
        </a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-text-strong mb-2 font-body font-extrabold">
        Donations
      </h3>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-[1.2rem] text-text-strong">
        If you'd like to support the work we do financially, please make a
        <a
          href="https://www.every.org/ai-safety-cape-town?utm_campaign=donate-link#/donate"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="text-link"
        >
          donation here
        </a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
